	linkml:slots <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-171/sp800171AssessmentObjective__assessed_requirement_item> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-171/sp800171AssessmentObjective__requirement_determination> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-171/sp800171AssessmentObjective__requirement_objective_id> .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-171/Sp800171Family> a linkml:ClassDefinition ;
